  "authorNotes": "Textbook: Class 1 প্রাথমিক গণিত (md in Downloads/md book/C1 Math md file). The md files number the chapters differently from the published syllabus (the single-chapter files call নিজে করি '11' and have no জ্যামিতি file; the 11–17 combined file has জ্যামিতি as 11). I used the SYLLABUS numbering in every bookRef and added the printed page, which is unambiguous: স্থানীয় মান pp74–78, নিজে করি pp79–81, জ্যামিতি pp82–85, প্যাটার্ন pp86–91, সংখ্যা ৪১–১০০ pp92–96, যোগ pp97–100, বিয়োগ pp101–104, মুদ্রা pp105–108, নিজে করি pp109–114. Reused from MP Annual 2026: number-to-words (3 + 3 taken from its English 'Write in Words' row), ascending/descending sets, place value (28, 50), 5 additions and 5 subtractions (MP's 42+8, 64+18, 54−17, 32−16, 90−58 need carrying/borrowing, which the Sylhet row forbids, so their numbers were changed), both word problems (36+25 changed to 36+23 to avoid carrying; names changed to textbook names), and all 5 shape-naming items. MP 2026 had no MCQ, words-to-digits, comparison (<, >, =), skip-a-box, pattern or money rows: MCQ/compare/pattern/money are new from the book; words-to-digits and skip-a-box follow MP Half-yearly 2026's format with numbers moved into 41–100. Doubts: (1) নামতা is not in the Class 1 book — I used the 8-times table (MP Annual 2025 asked exactly this; MP HY 2026 asked the 4-times table; MP 2026 instead asked 10 mixed facts like ৫×৩, ৭×৮). Please confirm which table Sylhet Class 1 has learned; (2) row 11 asks 'চেনা ও আঁকা', so 5 items name a shape and 1 asks the child to draw a তিনকোনা; the book only uses গোল / তিনকোনা / চারকোনা (accept বৃত্ত / ত্রিভুজ / চতুর্ভুজ too); (3) 13 items need pictures (shapes, notes/coins, two shape patterns); (4) duration not published — used 2 hours like MP."
